  "description": "YITAMOTOR 43'' x 45'' forklift safety work platform cage is constructed of sturdy and durable metallic iron, is designed for use with any standard forklift or pallet loader.\nFitment\nCan be used with all standard forklift or pallet loaders. Can help you complete aerial tasks. Use it to change lights and repair roofs. You can also use it for painting the exterior of homes or for performing tree services.\nFor your safety, professional installation recommended.\nFeatures\nSturdy and Reliable:\nThis 45\" x 43\" Forklift Safety Cage Work Platform Basket can safely support up to 1400lbs, ensuring secure and efficient operations.\nEnhanced Safety:\nWith its heavy-duty construction and protective railing, this safety cage provides a secure working platform for forklift operators, minimizing the risk of accidents.\nVersatile and Practical:\nDesigned for various applications, this work platform basket offers a convenient solution for working at elevated heights, improving productivity and accessibility.\nEasy Installation:\nQuick and hassle-free setup allows for immediate use, saving valuable time and effort.\nDurable Construction:\nMade with high-quality materials, this safety cage is built to withstand demanding work environments, ensuring long-lasting performance..",
